<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680" height="40px"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2014614867/Announcement_header_680x70.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas has partnered with the International Air Transport Association (IATA) to make our customers' experience easier whilst travelling during COVID-19.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The IATA Travel Pass application is a mobile app enabling you to:</font><ul style="margin: 5px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Check the travel requirements for your flights all in one place;</font></span></li><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Receive information directly from the same system that Qantas check-in agents use to check your eligibility to travel;</font></span></li><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Upload your digital COVID-19 test results and vaccine certificate in a secure manner, and automatically confirm that you meet the COVID-19 requirements for your flights;</font></span></li><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Share your 'OK to Travel' status with Qantas prior to arriving at the airport, allowing you to check-in online;</font></span></li><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Enjoy a streamlined and more convenient airport experience.</font></span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas will be progressively rolling out the IATA Travel Pass to be available on all Qantas International flights. Customers can start using the IATA Travel Pass on all Qantas flights between Australia and UK from 20 December 2021 onwards. Further international destinations will be available from early 2022.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please note that you will still need to bring paper copies of all travel documentation to the airport in case they are required at border control.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">More information on the IATA Travel Pass, including how to download the mobile app, is available to you on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/travelready/iata-travel-pass.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas.com" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Qantas.com</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your ongoing support. We look forward to welcoming you onboard our international flights soon.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}<br>{!User.Title}<br><br>Qantas Corporate Sales<br>Qantas Airways Limited<br><br>A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br>P. 13 10 85<br>E. {!User.Email}</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909750" style="font-family: Ciutadella, Arial, Verdana, serif; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" height="50" width="307" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2019333048/1710footerQantasOneworldLogo.jpg" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909880"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong>Qantas Privacy Notice</strong><br>Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13&nbsp;10&nbsp;85. To unsubscribe from Qantas updates or marketing offers, contact your Account Manager&nbsp;<a href="mailto:?subject=Unsubscribe%20from%20Qantas%20marketing%20offers" target="_blank" title="Unsubscribe" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;">here</a>&nbsp;to unsubscribe.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr></tr><tr><td align="center" colspan="2" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
